```

Sum of vector elements.  Works on any Addable type.  `init` is the identity to start from; leave it out and the element type's own zero is used (0, 0.0, ""). Example: sum(\[10, 20, 12\], 0) == 42 Example: sum(\[10, 20, 12\]) == 42

```rust
