```

Directory part of a path — strips the trailing `/\<segment\>`. "doc/claude/PROBLEMS.md".dir() → "doc/claude" "CLAUDE.md".dir()              → ""   (no `/`) "/etc/passwd".dir()            → "/etc" "".dir()                        → ""

```rust
