```

Last segment of a path — the part after the trailing `/`. "doc/claude/PROBLEMS.md".basename() → "PROBLEMS.md" "CLAUDE.md".basename()              → "CLAUDE.md" "/foo/".basename()                   → ""    (trailing slash) "".basename()                        → ""

```rust
